## The Spirit of the Licence

This licence is a pact. It is a promise that Ex-OS will remain a sanctuary for your thoughts. It is a commitment to building technology that empowers, rather than exploits.

Use it to build, to learn, to discover.

Use it to keep your thoughts yours.

